    "message": "Prove literal spatial and temporal neighboring bit equalities\n\nBind all eight East/previous-West and nine South/temporal-North copies to the actual complete convolution and masks. Remove only proved unsupported inputs, derive incoming carry resets, and retain reflected collisions until parity is applied.\n\nCertify both cyclic source bases and the exact whole-cell temporal stride, including zero and large shifts. Specialize to original Facts with count and fractional phase derived internally; whole-field alignment is provided by the preceding packet. Add root full-source review, two fresh direct Lean builds and six standard-only axiom reports. Keep occupation, label matching and machine semantics as subsequent obligations.",
